## Git commit workflow per phase (commit before next)

**Hard rule:** each loop part that changes the repo must finish with a git commit **before** the next part starts.

| Phase | Who commits | When | Convention |
|-------|-------------|------|------------|
| Plan | — (readonly) | No repo edits | Plan text → `.cursor/orchestra-plan.md` (gitignored) |
| Implement | **Implementer** | After all plan files done, **before** `IMPLEMENT_DONE` | `<type>(<scope>): <desc>` |
| Verify | — (readonly) | Must see clean tree; `VERIFY_FAIL` if dirty code | Checks only |
| Review | Parent (docs only) | After `ORCHESTRA_COMPLETE` if `progress-tracker` / docs dirty | `docs(...): ...` |
| FIX_REQUIRED loop | **Implementer** | Commit fixes **before** re-verify | same convention |

Parent checklist before each phase advance:
1. `git status --porcelain` is empty (or only allowed plan file)
2. Last phase ended with its marker (`PLAN_READY` / `IMPLEMENT_DONE` / `VERIFY_PASS` / `ORCHESTRA_COMPLETE`)
3. Then launch the next `orchestra-*` Task subagent

After `ORCHESTRA_COMPLETE`, commit any remaining doc sync (`context/progress-tracker.md`) in a separate docs commit if dirty.

## Model routing (cheap + best)

Default to **Composer 2.5 standard** (not Fast) for all orchestra phases. It is the cheapest strong agent in the included Cursor Models pool and handles planning, implementation, verification, and review. Escalate to **Grok 4.6 standard** (`effort: high`) only for hard or long-horizon tasks. Avoid Fast variants and Other Models (Claude/GPT/Gemini) as defaults — they consume the smaller $20+ Other Models pool 3–6× faster.

All Cursor `bundle/agents/orchestra-*.md` files now carry `model: composer-2.5` frontmatter. Set the IDE default via the model picker or `bash scripts/setup-cursor-model.sh`.

## Six-File Context (when `context/` exists in workspace)

If the project has `context/project-overview.md` (and related files), hooks inject read order at session start. Subagents must read present context files before acting. Bootstrap blanks: `bash scripts/init-context.sh <project-dir>` from the pcore-orchestra repo.

Files: `~/.cursor/hooks.json`, `~/.cursor/agents/orchestra-*.md`.
